WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.416
Dingo: Welcome to my kitchen! Have you ever made onion soup? Let's make one together.

2
00:00:04.816 --> 00:00:06.448
Dingo: First, grab an onion.

3
00:00:06.848 --> 00:00:08.312
Dingo: Now drop it in the pot.

4
00:00:08.712 --> 00:00:10.032
Dingo: Let it cook for a bit.

5
00:00:10.432 --> 00:00:11.416
Dingo: Grab a plate.

6
00:00:11.816 --> 00:00:13.016
Dingo: Serve it right here!

7
00:00:13.416 --> 00:00:17.352
Dingo: You did it! That's a perfect bowl. You're officially a Soup Master!

8
00:00:17.752 --> 00:00:22.288
Wendy: Hi! I'm Wendy, nice to meet you! Ooh, is that soup? It smells amazing!

9
00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:27.248
Kai: Um... hello. I'm Kai. We're new here... could you show us how to make soup?

10
00:00:27.648 --> 00:00:36.672
Dingo: They're my new apprentices. They can't learn just by watching. They learn from stars. Every time they do a step right, you give them a star. Will you teach them?
